\rtlch\fcs1 \af387 \ltrch\fcs0 \f387\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 1/ \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af395 \ltrch\fcs0 \f395\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3f
c doanh l\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp (c\'e1c l\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp, c\'e1c li\'ean hi\u7879\'3fp l\'e2m n\'f4ng c\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh l\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp kh\'e1c thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 
\'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng, d\'fd\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3fi t\u7855\'3ft l\'e0 c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh l\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp):
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 To\'e0n b\u7897\'3f s\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af395 \ltrch\fcs0 \f395\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \u7915\'3fng c\u7911\'3f
a c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh l\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng (bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa nh
\u7919\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm do c\'e1c l\u7921\'3fc l\'fd\u7907\'3fng kh\'e1c khai th\'e1c tr\'ean l\'e2m ph\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa l\'e2m tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng) \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi cho \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f v\'e0 Ng\'e2n s
\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc nh\'fd sau:
\par a- \'d0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f 60% s\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7853\'3fp qu\u7929\'3f nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng d\'f9ng v\'e0o vi\u7879\'3fc \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd
 x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng v\u7889\'3fn r\u7915\'3fng t\u7841\'3fi ch\u7895\'3f theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch h\'e0ng n\'e3m v\'e0 theo d\u7921\'3f \'e1n ho\u7863\'3fc lu\u7853\'3fn ch\u7913\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907
\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn x\'e9t duy\u7879\'3ft.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 b- 40% s\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng c\'f2n l\u7841\'3fi}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af395 \ltrch\fcs0 \f395\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221  n
\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ti\u7871\'3ft (100%) cho Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng (t\u7881\'3fnh, huy\u7879\'3fn, x}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'e3) qua h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af395 \ltrch\fcs0 \f395\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'fd\u7899\'3fc (Chi c\u7909\'3fc Kho b\u7841\'3fc ho\u7863\'3f
c Chi nh\'e1nh Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc) \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7853\'3fp qu\u7929\'3f nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng t\u7853\'3fp trung c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng.
\par 2/ \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f, h\u7897\'3f gia }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af387 \ltrch\fcs0 \f387\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'ecnh v\'e0 t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af395 \ltrch\fcs0 \f395\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'fd nh\'e2n, c\'e1 th\u7875\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc giao \'f0\u7845\'3ft, giao r\u7915
\'3fng \'f0\u7875\'3f tr\u7891\'3fng r\u7915\'3fng v\'e0 ch\'e3m s\'f3c, nu\'f4i d\'fd\u7905\'3fng, khai th\'e1c g\u7895\'3f v\'e0 l\'e2m s\u7843\'3fn: S\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e2n ph\u7889
\'3fi nh\'fd sau:
\par a- Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7891\'3fng \'f0\u7875\'3f tr\u7891\'3fng r\u7915\'3fng (bao g\u7891\'3fm qu\u7871\'3f, h\u7891\'3fi v\'e0 c\'e1c \'f0\u7863\'3fc s\u7843\'3fn kh\'e1c) \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f
 l\u7841\'3fi 80% s\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng \'f0\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd ti\u7871\'3fp cho chu k\u7923\'3f sau, c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'f2n 20% n\u7897
\'3fp v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af395 \ltrch\fcs0 \f395\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'fd\u7899\'3fc qua c\'f5 quan Ki\u7875\'3fm l\'e2m nh\'e2n d\'e2n khu v\u7921\'3fc.
\par b- Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fn r\u7915\'3fng t\u7921\'3f nhi\'ean \'f0\u7875\'3f ch\'e3m s\'f3c, nu\'f4i d\'fd\u7905\'3fng (bao g\u7891\'3fm qu\u7871\'3f, h\u7891\'3fi v\'e0 c\'e1c \'f0\u7863\'3fc s\u7843\'3fn kh\'e1c) \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3f
c \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi 60% s}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af387 \ltrch\fcs0 \f387\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng \'f0\u7875\'3f tu b\u7893\'3f l\u7841\'3fi r\u7915\'3fng \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'e3 khai th\'e1c, c\'f2n 40% n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af395 \ltrch\fcs0 \f395\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'fd\u7899\'3fc qua c\'f5 quan Ki
\u7875\'3fm l\'e2m nh\'e2n d\'e2n khu v\u7921\'3fc.
\par c- S\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng 20% \u7903\'3f ti\u7871\'3ft (a) v\'e0 40% \u7903\'3f ti\u7871\'3ft (b) n\'f3i tr\'ean \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 \'f0i\u7873\'3f
u ti\u7871\'3ft 100% cho Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng.
\par 3/ T\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ti\u7871\'3ft s\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng n\'f3i \u7903\'3f ti\u7871\'3ft b, \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 1 v\'e0 \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 2 n\'f3i tr\'ean n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o m\u7895\'3fi c
\u7845\'3fp ng\'e2n s\'e1ch (t\u7881\'3fnh, huy\u7879\'3fn, x}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'e3) do U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af395 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f395\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu (d\'fd\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3fi t\u7855\'3ft l\'e0 t\u7881\'3fnh) quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qc \li0\ri0\keepn\widctlpar\tx1251\tx1971\tx2691\tx3411\tx4131\tx4851\tx5571\tx6291\tx7011\tx7731\tx8451\tx9171\tx9891\tx10611\tx11331\tx12051\wrapdefault\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6752469 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 II/ T\u7892\'3f CH\u7912\'3fC THU V\u7872\'3f TI\u7872\'3fN NU\'d4I R\u7914\'3fNG.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl-320\slmult0\widctlpar\tx1251\tx1971\tx2691\tx3411\tx4131\tx4851\tx5571\tx6291\tx7011\tx7731\tx8451\tx9171\tx9891\tx10611\tx11331\tx12051\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid226458 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af395 \ltrch\fcs0 \f395\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 K\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y 1/1/1990, Li\'ean B\u7897\'3f L\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp - T\'e0i ch\'ednh th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft giao cho l\u7921\'3fc l\'fd\u7907\'3fng Ki
\u7875\'3fm l\'e2m nh\'e2n d\'e2n thu s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh, t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f, c\'e1 th\u7875\'3f tr\'ean \'f0\u7883\'3fa b\'e0n t\u7881\'3f
nh (n\'f3i \u7903\'3f ti\u7871\'3ft b, \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 1 v\'e0 \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 2 m\u7909\'3fc I tr\'ean \'f0\'e2y) v\'e0 n\u7897\'3fp kho\u7843\'3fn thu ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng n\'e0y v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 \'f0
i\u7873\'3fu ti\u7871\'3ft 100% cho Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng qua h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc (Chi nh\'e1nh Kho b\u7841\'3fc ho\u7863\'3fc Chi c\u7909\'3fc Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3f
c) th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ti\u7871\'3ft cho c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp ng\'e2n s\'e1ch do t\u7881\'3fnh qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'fd (Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch t\u7881
\'3fnh, huy\u7879\'3fn).
\par Chi c\u7909\'3fc (ho\u7863\'3fc ph\'f2ng) thu qu\u7889\'3fc doanh thu\u7897\'3fc S\u7903\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 S\u7903\'3f L\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp (ho\u7863\'3fc S\u7903\'3f N\'f4ng L\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp) t\u7881\'3fnh c\'f3 nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f
 ch\u7881\'3f }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af395 \ltrch\fcs0 \f395\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid608296\charrsid15491221 \'f0\u7841\'3fo, ki\u7875\'3fm tra, \'f0\'f4n \'f0\u7889\'3fc c\'e1c H\u7841\'3ft Ki\u7875\'3fm l\'e2m nh\'e2n d\'e2n thu, n\u7897\'3fp \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0
\u7911\'3f v\'e0 k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn nu\'f4i r\u7915\'3fng tr\'ean \'f0\u7883\'3fa b\'e0n v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
